---
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';

const title = `Technology | ${SITE_TITLE}`;
const description = 'Explore how AlienX engineers websites, applications, automation, APIs, data flows, infrastructure, and production systems.';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><BaseHead title={title} description={description} /></head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">ALIENX / TECHNOLOGY</p>
          <h1>Built from the <span>web outward.</span></h1>
          <p class="lede">AlienX builds technology as a connected system: interfaces on the front, logic behind them, automation around them, and infrastructure underneath everything.</p>
          <div class="hero-tags"><span>WEB</span><span>APPS</span><span>APIs</span><span>AUTOMATION</span><span>INFRASTRUCTURE</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="system-map" aria-label="AlienX technology system map">
          <div class="map-core"><span>ALIENX</span><strong>ENGINEERING</strong></div>
          <div class="map-node map-node--top"><small>INTERFACE</small><strong>FRONTEND</strong></div>
          <div class="map-node map-node--right"><small>LOGIC</small><strong>BACKEND</strong></div>
          <div class="map-node map-node--bottom"><small>OPERATE</small><strong>INFRASTRUCTURE</strong></div>
          <div class="map-node map-node--left"><small>CONNECT</small><strong>AUTOMATION</strong></div>
          <i class="map-line map-line--one"></i><i class="map-line map-line--two"></i><i class="map-line map-line--three"></i><i class="map-line map-line--four"></i>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="capabilities" id="capabilities" aria-labelledby="capabilities-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">01 / WHAT WE BUILD</p>
          <h2 id="capabilities-title">Technology is more than a <span>stack.</span></h2>
          <p>These are the engineering disciplines that can combine into a real product, service, internal tool, or automated workflow.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="capability-grid">
          <article class="capability capability--hero">
            <span class="number">01</span><p class="kicker">FRONTEND ENGINEERING</p>
            <h3>Interfaces with structure, motion, and intent.</h3>
            <p>Semantic HTML, modern CSS, TypeScript, responsive systems, component architecture, browser APIs, progressive enhancement, and interaction design.</p>
            <div class="tech-strip"><span>HTML</span><span>CSS</span><span>JS / TS</span><span>ASTRO</span><span>ACCESSIBILITY</span></div>
          </article>
          <article class="capability">
            <span class="number">02</span><p class="kicker">APPLICATIONS</p>
            <h3>Websites are only one kind of software.</h3>
            <p>Interactive tools, client portals, internal applications, dashboards, forms, content systems, and custom browser experiences built around the problem.</p>
            <div class="capability-mark"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          </article>
          <article class="capability">
            <span class="number">03</span><p class="kicker">BACKEND / APIs</p>
            <h3>Give the interface a reliable system behind it.</h3>
            <p>Validation, request handling, typed boundaries, integrations, data persistence, webhooks, authentication flows, and failure-aware server logic.</p>
            <div class="endpoint"><span>POST</span><strong>/api/</strong><b>VALIDATED</b></div>
          </article>
          <article class="capability capability--wide">
            <span class="number">04</span><p class="kicker">AUTOMATION + AI</p>
            <h3>Connect the work that humans shouldn't have to repeat.</h3>
            <p>Event-driven workflows can move information between websites, APIs, email, databases, business tools, and AI services. The goal is not automation for its own sake; it is removing friction from a real process.</p>
            <div class="workflow" aria-label="Automation architecture">
              <div><small>TRIGGER</small><strong>EVENT</strong></div><b>→</b><div><small>DECIDE</small><strong>LOGIC / AI</strong></div><b>→</b><div><small>EXECUTE</small><strong>ACTION</strong></div><b>→</b><div><small>VERIFY</small><strong>RESULT</strong></div>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="capability">
            <span class="number">05</span><p class="kicker">DATA</p>
            <h3>Move information without losing control.</h3>
            <p>Payloads, schemas, transformations, validation, storage, exports, imports, and service-to-service data flows designed around clear contracts.</p>
            <div class="data-flow"><span>INPUT</span><i></i><span>SCHEMA</span><i></i><span>DATA</span></div>
          </article>
          <article class="capability">
            <span class="number">06</span><p class="kicker">INFRASTRUCTURE</p>
            <h3>Ship it. Run it. Know when it breaks.</h3>
            <p>Cloud and edge deployment, DNS, environments, caching, observability, source control, build pipelines, and operational boundaries.</p>
            <div class="infra-stack"><span>SOURCE</span><span>BUILD</span><span>EDGE</span><span>OBSERVE</span></div>
          </article>
          <article class="capability capability--wide">
            <span class="number">07</span><p class="kicker">PERFORMANCE + SECURITY</p>
            <h3>Quality is an engineering constraint, not a finishing pass.</h3>
            <div class="quality-grid"><div><strong>PERFORMANCE</strong><p>Reduce unnecessary work, payload, blocking, and rendering cost.</p></div><div><strong>SECURITY</strong><p>Validate inputs, protect secrets, minimize privilege, and respect trust boundaries.</p></div><div><strong>ACCESSIBILITY</strong><p>Make interaction operable, understandable, and usable across devices and abilities.</p></div></div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="layers" aria-labelledby="layers-title">
        <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">02 / SYSTEM LAYERS</p><h2 id="layers-title">One product. <span>Many layers.</span></h2><p>Good systems make the boundaries between layers explicit instead of hiding complexity behind a single buzzword.</p></div>
        <div class="layer-table">
          <button class="layer is-selected" type="button" data-layer="interface"><span>01</span><strong>Interface</strong><small>What the user sees and operates.</small><b>FRONTEND</b></button>
          <button class="layer" type="button" data-layer="application"><span>02</span><strong>Application</strong><small>What the product actually does.</small><b>BACKEND</b></button>
          <button class="layer" type="button" data-layer="automation"><span>03</span><strong>Automation</strong><small>What happens without another click.</small><b>WORKFLOWS</b></button>
          <button class="layer" type="button" data-layer="operations"><span>04</span><strong>Operations</strong><small>Where the system lives and how it is observed.</small><b>INFRA</b></button>
        </div>
        <div class="layer-detail" data-layer-detail>Responsive composition, semantic structure, interaction, accessibility, and browser-native capabilities.</div>
      </section>

      <section class="toolbox" aria-labelledby="toolbox-title">
        <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">03 / TOOLBOX</p><h2 id="toolbox-title">Use the right tool for the <span>constraint.</span></h2></div>
        <div class="toolbox-grid">
          <div><span>WEB</span><p>HTML · CSS · JavaScript · TypeScript · Astro · MDX</p></div>
          <div><span>SERVER</span><p>APIs · validation · webhooks · data · integrations</p></div>
          <div><span>AUTOMATION</span><p>Events · workflows · scheduled jobs · AI-assisted tasks</p></div>
          <div><span>PLATFORM</span><p>Cloudflare · Git · CI/CD · DNS · edge delivery · observability</p></div>
          <div><span>QUALITY</span><p>Accessibility · performance · security · SEO · testing</p></div>
          <div><span>METHOD</span><p>Progressive enhancement · small primitives · explicit boundaries</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="principles" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
        <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">04 / ENGINEERING PRINCIPLES</p><h2 id="principles-title">The invisible parts still <span>matter.</span></h2></div>
        <div class="principle-grid">
          <article><span>01</span><h3>Progressive enhancement</h3><p>Start with a useful document. Add capability where it earns its complexity.</p></article>
          <article><span>02</span><h3>Performance as design</h3><p>Network, rendering, and asset decisions affect how the product feels.</p></article>
          <article><span>03</span><h3>Accessible by default</h3><p>Semantics, focus, keyboard behavior, contrast, and motion belong in the implementation.</p></article>
          <article><span>04</span><h3>Observable systems</h3><p>When something fails, the system should provide enough signal to understand why.</p></article>
          <article><span>05</span><h3>Secure boundaries</h3><p>Secrets, inputs, permissions, dependencies, and external services deserve explicit trust boundaries.</p></article>
          <article><span>06</span><h3>Human-readable engineering</h3><p>The next person maintaining the system is part of the architecture.</p></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cta"><div><p class="eyebrow">05 / THE OUTCOME</p><h2>Technology should make something <span>possible.</span></h2><p>Bring the problem. AlienX can help determine whether the right answer is a website, application, integration, automation, or a combination of all of them.</p></div><a href="/contact">Start a project <span>→</span></a></section>
    </main>
    <Footer />
    <script>
      const details={interface:'Responsive composition, semantic structure, interaction, accessibility, and browser-native capabilities.',application:'Request handling, validation, business logic, data contracts, integrations, and server-side processing.',automation:'Event-driven workflows, scheduled jobs, service connections, notifications, and AI-assisted actions.',operations:'Deployment, DNS, environments, caching, observability, source control, and runtime concerns.'};
      const detail=document.querySelector('[data-layer-detail]');
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-layer]').forEach((button)=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('[data-layer]').forEach((item)=>item.classList.remove('is-selected'));button.classList.add('is-selected');if(detail)detail.textContent=details[button.dataset.layer]??'';}));
    </script>
    <style>
      :global(html){background:var(--tech-bg);color:var(--tech-text)}
      :global(body){--tech-bg:#05070c;--tech-surface:#090d16;--tech-surface-2:#0d1320;--tech-text:#e8edf7;--tech-heading:#f8faff;--tech-muted:#9ca8bd;--tech-soft:#6f7b91;--tech-border:#1b2332;--tech-border-strong:#2b374c;--tech-blue:#6f82ff;--tech-green:var(--brand-green);margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 75% 0,rgba(111,130,255,.11),transparent 34rem),var(--tech-bg)}
      main{overflow:hidden}.hero,.capabilities,.layers,.toolbox,.principles,.cta{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:auto}.hero{min-height:calc(100vh - 90px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:70px;align-items:center;padding:80px 0 130px}.eyebrow{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.67rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.18em}.hero h1{max-width:850px;margin:0;color:var(--tech-heading);font-size:clamp(3.5rem,8vw,7.8rem);line-height:.86;letter-spacing:-.075em}.hero h1 span,h2 span{color:var(--tech-green)}.lede{max-width:700px;margin:28px 0 0;color:var(--tech-muted);font-size:clamp(1.05rem,1.8vw,1.28rem);line-height:1.7}.hero-tags{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px}.hero-tags span,.tech-strip span{padding:7px 9px;border:1px solid var(--tech-border-strong);border-radius:999px;color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.52rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.08em}.system-map{position:relative;min-height:500px;border:1px solid var(--tech-border-strong);border-radius:34px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(57,255,90,.06),transparent 38%),#060a11;overflow:hidden}.system-map:before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:12%;border:1px solid rgba(111,130,255,.12);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 0 70px rgba(111,130,255,.025),0 0 0 140px rgba(111,130,255,.018)}.map-core,.map-node{position:absolute;z-index:2;display:grid;gap:5px;text-align:center}.map-core{top:50%;left:50%;width:145px;height:145px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);place-content:center;border:1px solid rgba(57,255,90,.38);border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(57,255,90,.18),rgba(57,255,90,.02) 65%,transparent 66%);box-shadow:0 0 80px rgba(57,255,90,.1)}.map-core span{color:var(--tech-green);font-size:.55rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.16em}.map-core strong{color:var(--tech-heading);font-size:.82rem}.map-node{padding:13px 15px;border:1px solid var(--tech-border-strong);border-radius:13px;background:rgba(9,13,22,.92)}.map-node small{color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.5rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em}.map-node strong{color:var(--tech-heading);font-size:.7rem}.map-node--top{top:11%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%)}.map-node--right{top:50%;right:8%;transform:translateY(-50%)}.map-node--bottom{bottom:11%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%)}.map-node--left{top:50%;left:8%;transform:translateY(-50%)}.map-line{position:absolute;z-index:1;left:50%;top:50%;width:38%;height:1px;transform-origin:left;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--tech-green),transparent)}.map-line--one{transform:rotate(-90deg)}.map-line--two{transform:rotate(0deg)}.map-line--three{transform:rotate(90deg)}.map-line--four{transform:rotate(180deg)}
      .capabilities{padding:20px 0 150px}.section-heading{max-width:820px;margin-bottom:50px}.section-heading h2{margin:0;color:var(--tech-heading);font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5.5vw,5rem);line-height:.93;letter-spacing:-.06em}.section-heading>p:last-child{margin:20px 0 0;color:var(--tech-muted);line-height:1.75}.capability-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px}.capability{min-height:390px;padding:31px;border:1px solid var(--tech-border);border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--tech-surface),#060910);transition:border-color .2s ease,transform .2s ease}.capability:hover{border-color:#36435a;transform:translateY(-3px)}.capability--wide{grid-column:span 2}.capability--hero{min-height:450px}.number{color:var(--tech-blue);font-size:.58rem;font-weight:900}.kicker{margin:11px 0;color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.59rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.15em}.capability h3{max-width:680px;margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--tech-heading);font-size:1.55rem;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.035em}.capability>p:not(.kicker){max-width:720px;color:var(--tech-muted);line-height:1.72}.tech-strip{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:30px}.tech-strip span{color:var(--tech-blue)}.capability-mark{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:45px}.capability-mark i{width:70px;height:70px;border:1px solid var(--tech-border-strong);border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(111,130,255,.15),transparent)}.capability-mark i:nth-child(2){transform:translateY(-20px);border-color:rgba(57,255,90,.25)}.capability-mark i:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(-40px)}.endpoint{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:35px;padding:15px;border:1px solid var(--tech-border);border-radius:13px;background:#05080e;font:700 .63rem ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.endpoint span{color:var(--tech-blue)}.endpoint strong{color:var(--tech-text)}.endpoint b{margin-left:auto;color:var(--tech-green);font-size:.5rem}.workflow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;gap:9px;align-items:center;margin-top:34px}.workflow div{min-height:82px;display:grid;place-content:center;text-align:center;border:1px solid var(--tech-border-strong);border-radius:15px}.workflow small{color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.5rem;font-weight:800}.workflow strong{margin-top:5px;color:var(--tech-heading);font-size:.68rem}.workflow>b{color:var(--tech-green);font-size:.75rem}.data-flow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:42px}.data-flow span{padding:10px 11px;border:1px solid var(--tech-border-strong);border-radius:9px;color:var(--tech-text);font-size:.52rem;font-weight:900}.data-flow i{flex:1;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--tech-blue),var(--tech-green))}.infra-stack{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:7px;margin-top:35px}.infra-stack span{padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--tech-border);color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.52rem;font-weight:900}.quality-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;margin-top:30px;background:var(--tech-border)}.quality-grid div{padding:22px;background:var(--tech-surface)}.quality-grid strong{color:var(--tech-green);font-size:.58rem}.quality-grid p{margin:9px 0 0;color:var(--tech-muted);font-size:.68rem;line-height:1.65}
      .layers{padding:20px 0 150px}.layer-table{border:1px solid var(--tech-border);border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--tech-surface)}.layer{width:100%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:45px 1fr 1.5fr auto;gap:18px;align-items:center;padding:22px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--tech-border);background:transparent;color:var(--tech-text);text-align:left;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.layer:last-child{border-bottom:0}.layer>span,.layer>b{color:var(--tech-soft);font-size:.55rem;font-weight:900}.layer strong{font-size:.85rem}.layer small{color:var(--tech-muted);font-size:.62rem}.layer>b{color:var(--tech-blue)}.layer.is-selected{background:rgba(57,255,90,.04)}.layer.is-selected strong,.layer.is-selected>b{color:var(--tech-green)}.layer-detail{margin-top:12px;padding:21px 23px;border:1px solid var(--tech-border);border-radius:16px;color:var(--tech-muted);font-size:.7rem;line-height:1.7}.toolbox{padding:20px 0 150px}.toolbox-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border:1px solid var(--tech-border);background:var(--tech-border)}.toolbox-grid div{min-height:145px;padding:25px;background:var(--tech-surface)}.toolbox-grid span{color:var(--tech-blue);font-size:.55rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.13em}.toolbox-grid p{margin:15px 0 0;color:var(--tech-muted);font-size:.72rem;line-height:1.65}.principles{padding:20px 0 150px}.principle-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--tech-border);background:var(--tech-border)}.principle-grid article{min-height:165px;padding:26px;background:var(--tech-surface)}.principle-grid span{color:var(--tech-blue);font-size:.55rem;font-weight:900}.principle-grid h3{margin:14px 0 9px;color:var(--tech-heading);font-size:.95rem}.principle-grid p{margin:0;color:var(--tech-muted);font-size:.7rem;line-height:1.7}.cta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:50px;align-items:end;padding:75px 0 145px;border-top:1px solid var(--tech-border)}.cta h2{margin:0;color:var(--tech-heading);font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5.5vw,5rem);line-height:.93;letter-spacing:-.06em}.cta p:last-child{max-width:720px;color:var(--tech-muted);line-height:1.75}.cta a{display:inline-flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--tech-green);color:#041006;text-decoration:none;font-size:.74rem;font-weight:900;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 18px 55px rgba(57,255,90,.1)}
      @media(prefers-color-scheme:light){:global(html){background:#fff}:global(body){--tech-bg:#fff;--tech-surface:#f6f8fb;--tech-surface-2:#eef2f7;--tech-text:#253047;--tech-heading:#0d1420;--tech-muted:#61718c;--tech-soft:#71809a;--tech-border:#dfe5ee;--tech-border-strong:#c7d0df;--tech-blue:#5365db;--tech-green:var(--brand-green-dark);background:radial-gradient(circle at 75% 0,rgba(83,101,219,.07),transparent 34rem),var(--tech-bg)}.system-map{background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(22,128,59,.05),transparent 38%),#f6f8fb}.map-node{background:rgba(246,248,251,.94)}.capability{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff,#f6f8fb)}.endpoint{background:#f3f6fa}}
      @media(max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;min-height:auto;padding-top:70px}.capability-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.capability--wide{grid-column:auto}.quality-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.toolbox-grid,.principle-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.layer{grid-template-columns:40px 1fr auto}.layer small{grid-column:2}.cta{grid-template-columns:1fr;align-items:start}.workflow{grid-template-columns:1fr}.workflow>b{display:none}}
      @media(max-width:620px){.hero,.capabilities,.layers,.toolbox,.principles,.cta{width:min(100% - 28px,1180px)}.hero{padding:55px 0 90px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,15vw,5rem)}.system-map{min-height:390px}.map-node--right{right:4%}.map-node--left{left:4%}.capability{padding:23px;min-height:0}.workflow div{min-height:65px}.data-flow{gap:5px}.data-flow span{font-size:.46rem}.toolbox-grid,.principle-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.layer{grid-template-columns:30px 1fr auto;gap:10px}.layer>b{font-size:.47rem}}
      @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.capability{transition:none}}
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
